  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Proposed anatomical blueprint for \"a small freshwater animal that regenerates its limbs\": 8 organ systems, 38 organs, 92 tissues and 144 cell types that Uberon and the Cell Ontology record for Metazoa." .
